# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-08-03 11:17

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:13
translate italian jamie14a_b6dcf387:

    # "As I'm leaving for school, somebody calls my name."
    "Mentre sto uscendo per andare a scuola, qualcuno mi chiama per nome."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:14
translate italian jamie14a_b5d0fc44:

    # "Voice" "Hey, [pcname]!"
    "Voice" "Ehi, [pcname]!"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:17
translate italian jamie14a_42b89db9:

    # "Jamie's dad is waving me down and walking towards me."
    "Il papà di Jamie mi sta facendo cenno di fermarmi e sta venendo verso di me."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:18
translate italian jamie14a_8164aaf1:

    # "Wow, he's looking pretty rough. What the hell does he want?"
    "Cavolo, ha un aspetto piuttosto malconcio. Che diavolo vuole?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:19
translate italian jamie14a_cded88c7:

    # "I almost don't even stop. I don't have anything to say to this guy. I want to just keep going to my car and leave."
    "Per poco non proseguo senza fermarmi. Non ho niente da dire a questo tizio. Voglio solo andare alla mia auto e andarmene."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:20
translate italian jamie14a_aead936c:

    # "But something in his expression and his voice slows me down."
    "Ma qualcosa nella sua espressione e nella sua voce mi fa rallentare."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:23
translate italian jamie14a_bea7ca65:

    # jd "Hey, [pcname], can we talk for a minute?"
    jd "Ehi, [pcname], possiamo parlare un attimo?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:24
translate italian jamie14a_810a98a2:

    # pc "What do you want?"
    pc "Cosa vuoi?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:25
translate italian jamie14a_e6116fb2:

    # jd "I want to... apologize."
    jd "Voglio... chiederti scusa."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:26
translate italian jamie14a_65abe2d1:

    # jd "I messed up."
    jd "Ho fatto un casino."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:29
translate italian jamie14a_e9e8048e:

    # jd "I don't like you very much. I'm sure you know that."
    jd "Non mi piaci molto. Sono sicuro che lo sai."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:30
translate italian jamie14a_f70317e8:

    # jd "You broke her heart. I saw how much it hurt her."
    jd "Le hai spezzato il cuore. Ho visto quanto le facesse male."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:31
translate italian jamie14a_62f4e049:

    # jd "She stopped going out with her friends. Stopped trusting people."
    jd "Ha smesso di uscire con i suoi amici. Ha smesso di fidarsi delle persone."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:32
translate italian jamie14a_3e24a9b7:

    # jd "And I hated you for that. For hurting my little girl."
    jd "E ti ho odiato per questo. Per aver ferito la mia bambina."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:33
translate italian jamie14a_3ef77f3d:

    # jd "When she accepted you back so easily, I didn't understand, and I felt like I needed to protect her from you."
    jd "Quando ti ha riaccettato così facilmente, non capivo, e sentivo di doverla proteggere da te."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:36
translate italian jamie14a_4c6162ef:

    # jd "But now she's been hurt again and this time it wasn't you that did it."
    jd "Ma ora è stata ferita di nuovo e questa volta non sei stato tu a farlo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:37
translate italian jamie14a_154a6154:

    # jd "It was me."
    jd "Sono stata io."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:38
translate italian jamie14a_da05beb6:

    # jd "She really loves you, [pcname]."
    jd "Lei ti ama davvero, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:39
translate italian jamie14a_b624fa00:

    # jd "And she's going to resent me forever if I stand in the way of that."
    jd "E mi serberà rancore per sempre se mi metto di mezzo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:40
translate italian jamie14a_ab239c58:

    # pc "So you're saying that I can date Jamie again?"
    pc "Quindi stai dicendo che posso tornare a uscire con Jamie?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:43
translate italian jamie14a_7ffe4964:

    # jd "I'm saying that I'm going to step aside and let her do what she wants."
    jd "Sto dicendo che mi farò da parte e lascerò che lei faccia ciò che vuole."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:44
translate italian jamie14a_47573d93:

    # jd "And I'm going to do my best to get along with you."
    jd "E farò del mio meglio per andare d’accordo con te."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:45
translate italian jamie14a_07df80d6:

    # jd "And I hope that you'll accept my apology for getting too protective and overbearing."
    jd "E spero che accetterai le mie scuse per essermi dimostrata troppo protettiva e prepotente."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:46
translate italian jamie14a_a1317b53:

    # jd "I just can't stand seeing her sad."
    jd "Non sopporto proprio di vederla triste."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:49
translate italian jamie14a_359770ca:

    # jd "So, I'd like to have you over for dinner tonight, if you're not busy."
    jd "Quindi, vorrei invitarti a cena stasera, se non sei impegnato."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:50
translate italian jamie14a_ec06b19e:

    # jd "To show Jamie that I'm okay with you two."
    jd "Per dimostrare a Jamie che mi sta bene la vostra relazione."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:51
translate italian jamie14a_bd436701:

    # jd "And to try to repair this whole situation."
    jd "E per cercare di sistemare tutta questa situazione."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:52
translate italian jamie14a_19e76fb9:

    # jd "If that's okay with you?"
    jd "Se per te va bene?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:53
translate italian jamie14a_35da6d22:

    # pc "Sure, I think I can do that."
    pc "Certo, penso di poterlo fare."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:54
translate italian jamie14a_aec7f7b0:

    # jd "Will you shake my hand and put all this behind us?"
    jd "Mi stringi la mano e ci lasciamo tutto questo alle spalle?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:57
translate italian jamie14a_a17b9866:

    # pc "Yeah, I think that's a good idea."
    pc "Sì, penso che sia una buona idea."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:58
translate italian jamie14a_501230c4:

    # jd "Good. I'm sorry again."
    jd "Bene. Mi dispiace ancora."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:59
translate italian jamie14a_5487b9f8:

    # jd "I can see you're not the same as you were back then."
    jd "Vedo che non sei più lo stesso di allora."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:60
translate italian jamie14a_3e716201:

    # jd "I've seen how much happier Jamie has been since you've come back to Skyhill."
    jd "Ho visto quanto Jamie sia più felice da quando sei tornato a Skyhill."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:61
translate italian jamie14a_bb7d1c41:

    # jd "I just want her to be happy."
    jd "Voglio solo che lei sia felice."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:62
translate italian jamie14a_78ca39f6:

    # pc "I'll do my best to keep making her happy. I promise."
    pc "Farò del mio meglio per continuare a renderla felice. Te lo prometto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:65
translate italian jamie14a_c390597e:

    # jd "Alright, [pcname]. Well I'll see you later tonight."
    jd "Va bene, [pcname]. Beh, ci vediamo più tardi stasera."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:66
translate italian jamie14a_bf178f5a:

    # jd "How do you like your steaks?"
    jd "Come ti piacciono le bistecche?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:67
translate italian jamie14a_2e9a5edb:

    # pc "Medium rare."
    pc "Al sangue."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:68
translate italian jamie14a_778e6fc8:

    # jd "Good answer. See, I like you better already."
    jd "Ottima risposta. Vedi, mi piaci già di più."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:69
translate italian jamie14a_4a59320d:

    # pc "Okay, see you later."
    pc "Ok, ci vediamo più tardi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:72
translate italian jamie14a_0ced9731:

    # "After Jamie's dad leaves, I get in the car and head to school."
    "Dopo che il papà di Jamie se ne va, salgo in macchina e mi dirigo a scuola."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:73
translate italian jamie14a_1503cf89:

    # "Guess I'm going to be having dinner with them tonight."
    "Immagino che stasera cenerò con loro."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:74
translate italian jamie14a_6b9b4f27:

    # "I hope it's not too awkward!"
    "Spero che non sia troppo imbarazzante!"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:76
translate italian jamie14a_20fd986c:

    # "Later that evening..."
    "Più tardi quella sera..."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:86
translate italian jamie14_e1943713:

    # "I go home and get dressed, putting on something a little nicer than my work clothes, before walking over to Jamie's house to have dinner with her and her dad."
    "Torno a casa e mi cambio, indossando qualcosa di un po’ più elegante dei miei abiti da lavoro, prima di andare a piedi a casa di Jamie per cenare con lei e suo padre."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:89
translate italian jamie14_00286863:

    # "Before I even knock, Jamie's dad opens the door and greets me."
    "Prima ancora che io bussi, il padre di Jamie apre la porta e mi saluta."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:90
translate italian jamie14_05eb9994:

    # jd "Hey, [pcname]. Glad you came."
    jd "Ehi, [pcname]. Sono contento che tu sia venuta."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:91
translate italian jamie14_fc7fda3f:

    # jd "I wasn't sure you would. I know this is going to be a little awkward for everybody."
    jd "Non ero sicuro che lo avresti fatto. So che sarà un po’ imbarazzante per tutti."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:92
translate italian jamie14_87d64340:

    # pc "I think it'll be okay."
    pc "Penso che andrà tutto bene."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:93
translate italian jamie14_f9d3ac60:

    # jd "Good. I hope so. Come on in, I just put the steaks on the grill."
    jd "Bene. Lo spero anch’io. Entra pure, ho appena messo le bistecche sulla griglia."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:96
translate italian jamie14_baa894d7:

    # pc "Where's Jamie?"
    pc "Dov’è Jamie?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:97
translate italian jamie14_a4f2a7fd:

    # jd "She's still up in her room. She's barely left since I made her break up with you."
    jd "È ancora nella sua stanza. Non è quasi mai uscita da quando le ho fatto rompere con te."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:98
translate italian jamie14_f3737b26:

    # jd "I'm going to call her down for dinner when it's ready and let you surprise her."
    jd "La chiamerò per cena quando sarà pronta e lascerò che tu le faccia una sorpresa."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:101
translate italian jamie14_473a3bfb:

    # jd "I think it'll make her happy to see us getting along."
    jd "Penso che sarà felice di vederci andare d’accordo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:102
translate italian jamie14_217a60e1:

    # pc "I hope so. I'm looking forward to seeing her."
    pc "Lo spero anch’io. Non vedo l’ora di vederla."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:103
translate italian jamie14_f8b1bf29:

    # pc "I've been missing her the last week."
    pc "Mi è mancata tantissimo nell’ultima settimana."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:104
translate italian jamie14_b320763c:

    # jd "Yeah. I know she missed you too. I'm sorry again."
    jd "Sì. So che anche a lei sei mancato. Mi dispiace ancora."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:105
translate italian jamie14_d68d94af:

    # pc "It's alright. I know you were just trying to protect your daughter."
    pc "Va tutto bene. So che stavi solo cercando di proteggere tua figlia."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:106
translate italian jamie14_9810dcb5:

    # pc "I'm glad she has a dad who loves her so much. I know she loves you very much too."
    pc "Sono felice che abbia un papà che la ama così tanto. So che anche lei ti vuole molto bene."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:109
translate italian jamie14_dde4aef6:

    # jd "Thanks, [pcname]. That makes me really glad to hear."
    jd "Grazie, [pcname]. Mi fa davvero piacere sentirlo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:110
translate italian jamie14_884f0447:

    # jd "I hope she'll forgive me for all of this."
    jd "Spero che mi perdonerà per tutto questo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:111
translate italian jamie14_961e07b1:

    # pc "I know she will."
    pc "So che lo farà."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:112
translate italian jamie14_8a978913:

    # jd "My name is Richard, by the way. Rich to friends. I don't know if I've ever really introduced myself."
    jd "A proposito, mi chiamo Richard. Rich per gli amici. Non so se mi sono mai presentato davvero."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:116
translate italian jamie14_4c30d37e:

    # jd "Of course, I hadn't talked to you since you were a punk kid, playing Donkey Kong and sneaking feels in my daughter's bedroom."
    jd "Certo, non ti parlavo da quando eri un ragazzino ribelle, che giocava a Donkey Kong e si intrufolava nella camera da letto di mia figlia."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:117
translate italian jamie14_078bc847:

    # pc "Oh we never did that."
    pc "Oh, non l’abbiamo mai fatto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:118
translate italian jamie14_acfa9a92:

    # jd "Sure you didn't! And she was just sleeping over at your house last week because your bed is more comfortable."
    jd "Ma certo che no! E lei ha solo dormito da te la settimana scorsa perché il tuo letto è più comodo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:119
translate italian jamie14_e7874c6c:

    # pc "That's right."
    pc "Esatto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:120
translate italian jamie14_f9b86ca6:

    # "He laughs and I find myself laughing with him. He's not so bad when he doesn't seem to want to kill me."
    "Lui ride e mi ritrovo a ridere con lui. Non è poi così male quando non sembra volermi uccidere."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:125
translate italian jamie14_d41d8cd9:

    # voice "voices/jamie_031.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_031.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:126
translate italian jamie14_3b4e87c7:

    # gnd "Uh...What the heck is going on here?"
    gnd "Ehm… Che diavolo sta succedendo qui?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:127
translate italian jamie14_7574532d:

    # jd "Oh, hey honey. I was about to go upstairs and get you. Dinner's ready."
    jd "Oh, ciao tesoro. Stavo per salire di sopra a chiamarti. La cena è pronta."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:128
translate italian jamie14_23866c5e:

    # gnd "I am very confused right now. Why is [pcname] here?"
    gnd "Sono molto confusa in questo momento. Perché [pcname] è qui?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:131
translate italian jamie14_e2bc8a1e:

    # jd "Because I made a mistake."
    jd "Perché ho commesso un errore."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:132
translate italian jamie14_0ed25bb5:

    # jd "In trying to protect you from getting your heart broken again..."
    jd "Nel tentativo di proteggerti da un’altra delusione d’amore..."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:133
translate italian jamie14_1d42c416:

    # jd "... I ended up breaking it myself."
    jd "... ho finito per spezzarti il cuore io stessa."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:134
translate italian jamie14_b2095d7e:

    # jd "I'm sorry honey."
    jd "Mi dispiace, tesoro."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:135
translate italian jamie14_f3239e98:

    # jd "I'm okay with you dating [pcname]. I'm okay with you doing whatever makes you happy."
    jd "Per me va bene che tu esca con [pcname]. Per me va bene che tu faccia qualsiasi cosa ti renda felice."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:136
translate italian jamie14_bb351aa3:

    # gnd "Really, Daddy?"
    gnd "Davvero, papà?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:137
translate italian jamie14_ca7717c2:

    # jd "Really really."
    jd "Davvero, davvero."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:140
translate italian jamie14_4e39c56f:

    # gnd "Thank you, Daddy."
    gnd "Grazie, papà."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:141
translate italian jamie14_04061eae:

    # jd "I love you, honey. I hope you know that."
    jd "Ti voglio bene, tesoro. Spero che tu lo sappia."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:142
translate italian jamie14_63418466:

    # gnd "I love you too, Daddy."
    gnd "Anch’io ti voglio bene, papà."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:143
translate italian jamie14_0b8d1eb2:

    # jd "I'll take the steaks inside and get the table set. I know you two need to talk."
    jd "Porto le bistecche dentro e preparo la tavola. So che voi due avete bisogno di parlare."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:146
translate italian jamie14_69e44ecf:

    # "He carries the food inside and shuts the back door as Jamie walks slowly to me."
    "Porta il cibo dentro e chiude la porta sul retro mentre Jamie cammina lentamente verso di me."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:148
translate italian jamie14_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice "voices/jamie_009b.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_009b.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:149
translate italian jamie14_24b3ee56:

    # gnd "I'm sorry that I cut things off like I did."
    gnd "Mi dispiace di aver interrotto le cose in quel modo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:150
translate italian jamie14_4addc5b6:

    # gnd "I didn't know what to do."
    gnd "Non sapevo cosa fare."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:151
translate italian jamie14_607ff19c:

    # gnd "I've been crying about it all week."
    gnd "Ho pianto per questo tutta la settimana."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:153
translate italian jamie14_d41d8cd9_2:

    # voice "voices/jamie_032.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_032.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:154
translate italian jamie14_83f69a35:

    # gnd "Are we okay?"
    gnd "Va tutto bene tra noi?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:155
translate italian jamie14_2e8693f0:

    # pc "Yeah, baby. We're okay."
    pc "Sì, tesoro. Va tutto bene."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:156
translate italian jamie14_d481f95f:

    # pc "Come here."
    pc "Vieni qui."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:159
translate italian jamie14_e043500c:

    # gnd "I missed you so much."
    gnd "Mi sei mancato tantissimo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:160
translate italian jamie14_4295bf3d:

    # pc "I missed you too."
    pc "Anche tu mi sei mancato."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:161
translate italian jamie14_c2110f18:

    # "We kiss like that for a long time. She clings to me like she never wants to let go."
    "Ci baciamo così per un bel po'. Lei si aggrappa a me come se non volesse mai lasciarmi andare."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:164
translate italian jamie14_d87fd08d:

    # "Then the back door opens and Rich peeks out."
    "Poi la porta sul retro si apre e Rich fa capolino."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:165
translate italian jamie14_774c15a1:

    # jd "Oh, um... sorry. Honey, where is the A1?"
    jd "Oh, ehm... scusa. Tesoro, dov’è l’A1?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:166
translate italian jamie14_8d809a41:

    # "Jamie doesn't break off the kiss to answer, her lips never leaving mine."
    "Jamie non interrompe il bacio per rispondere, le sue labbra non si staccano mai dalle mie."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:167
translate italian jamie14_50d35669:

    # gnd "Bottom shelf of the refrigerator door."
    gnd "Ripiano in basso della porta del frigorifero."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:168
translate italian jamie14_13f55642:

    # jd "Okay, thanks honey."
    jd "Ok, grazie tesoro."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:169
translate italian jamie14_d6a09f10:

    # jd "Um... everything's on the table, if you're ready to eat."
    jd "Ehm... è tutto sul tavolo, se sei pronta a mangiare."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:170
translate italian jamie14_fc544f46:

    # gnd "Okay, Daddy. We'll be in in just a minute."
    gnd "Ok, papà. Arriviamo tra un minuto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:171
translate italian jamie14_232ae60e:

    # jd "Okay."
    jd "Ok."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:172
translate italian jamie14_103466ed:

    # jd "Um... no rush."
    jd "Ehm... non c'è fretta."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:173
translate italian jamie14_f05f4276:

    # "He closes the door and goes back inside."
    "Chiude la porta e torna dentro."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:176
translate italian jamie14_22af107a:

    # gnd "You're right, you know. I should have just stood up and told him what was going on a long time ago."
    gnd "Hai ragione, sai. Avrei dovuto semplicemente alzarmi e dirgli cosa stava succedendo molto tempo fa."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:177
translate italian jamie14_16efaa2c:

    # pc "It all worked out in the end."
    pc "Alla fine è andato tutto bene."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:178
translate italian jamie14_01c5d588:

    # gnd "Yeah, but... what if it hadn't."
    gnd "Sì, ma... e se non fosse andata così?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:179
translate italian jamie14_e8c450c3:

    # gnd "I really need to work on that. Standing up for myself."
    gnd "Devo davvero lavorarci su. Imparare a farmi valere."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:180
translate italian jamie14_0821365b:

    # gnd "And I will."
    gnd "E lo farò."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:182
translate italian jamie14_d41d8cd9_3:

    # voice "voices/jamie_033.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_033.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:183
translate italian jamie14_58ddd8ce:

    # gnd "I'm making a promise. If I want something, I'm going to fight for it."
    gnd "Me lo prometto. Se voglio qualcosa, lotterò per ottenerla."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:185
translate italian jamie14_d41d8cd9_4:

    # voice "voices/jamie_034.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_034.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:186
translate italian jamie14_e5bd6c1c:

    # gnd "I'm not going to let it slip away again, just because I might make somebody upset."
    gnd "Non lascerò che mi sfugga di nuovo, solo perché potrei far arrabbiare qualcuno."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:187
translate italian jamie14_24f5981e:

    # pc "I like that. Your happiness is very important."
    pc "Mi piace questo tuo atteggiamento. La tua felicità è molto importante."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:190
translate italian jamie14_1075fe75:

    # gnd "Well, I'm very happy right now."
    gnd "Beh, in questo momento sono molto felice."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:191
translate italian jamie14_cee162e3:

    # gnd "Although if I knew you were coming, I would have dressed up a little. Maybe brushed my hair."
    gnd "Anche se, se avessi saputo che saresti venuta, mi sarei vestito un po’ meglio. Magari mi sarei pettinato."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:192
translate italian jamie14_709e8dfa:

    # pc "You're gorgeous. Don't worry about that. I'm just glad to be here with you."
    pc "Sei bellissima. Non preoccuparti di questo. Sono solo felice di essere qui con te."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:193
translate italian jamie14_dfd62f7e:

    # gnd "You're so amazing."
    gnd "Sei davvero fantastica."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:194
translate italian jamie14_c77df519:

    # gnd "Let's go eat."
    gnd "Andiamo a mangiare."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:198
translate italian jamie14_1720c2ef:

    # "We go inside and sit with her dad and have dinner."
    "Entriamo, ci sediamo con suo padre e ceniamo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:199
translate italian jamie14_5d82c2b8:

    # "It's not as awkward as I was expecting it to be. Once he gets talking, Rich is pretty funny actually."
    "Non è così imbarazzante come mi aspettavo. Una volta che inizia a parlare, Rich è davvero divertente."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:200
translate italian jamie14_9c723875:

    # "He talks about his work and asks about my school and work."
    "Mi parla del suo lavoro e mi chiede della scuola e del mio lavoro."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:201
translate italian jamie14_bc6f8d22:

    # "He seems genuinely interested in me and over the course of the meal I can feel him warming up to me a bit."
    "Sembra sinceramente interessato a me e, nel corso della cena, sento che si sta aprendo un po' con me."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:204
translate italian jamie14_ea50946f:

    # jd "I was sorry to hear about your dad. Still no word on what happened to him?"
    jd "Mi è dispiaciuto sapere di tuo padre. Ancora nessuna notizia su cosa gli sia successo?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:205
translate italian jamie14_7fbf1a0e:

    # pc "No, not yet."
    pc "No, non ancora."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:206
translate italian jamie14_487d47b7:

    # jd "It's really strange."
    jd "È davvero strano."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:207
translate italian jamie14_ede84000:

    # jd "We used to talk through the fence pretty often, but I hadn't seen him in months before the police got involved."
    jd "Un tempo parlavamo spesso attraverso la recinzione, ma non lo vedevo da mesi prima che intervenisse la polizia."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:208
translate italian jamie14_86681f0f:

    # pc "Yeah, he became a bit of a hermit, I guess. Spent all his time in his office in the basement."
    pc "Sì, era diventato un po’ un eremita, immagino. Passava tutto il tempo nel suo ufficio nel seminterrato."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:211
translate italian jamie14_913c87c9:

    # jd "Well, I hope he turns up."
    jd "Beh, spero che si faccia vivo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:212
translate italian jamie14_1bbf0a93:

    # jd "Hopefully he just took some time off to himself and he'll come home eventually."
    jd "Speriamo che si sia solo preso un po’ di tempo per sé e che alla fine torni a casa."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:213
translate italian jamie14_e82b335f:

    # pc "I hope so."
    pc "Lo spero anch’io."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:214
translate italian jamie14_4543d9f2:

    # "Sitting here and talking to Jamie's dad just reminds me how much I miss my own father."
    "Stare qui a parlare con il papà di Jamie mi fa solo ricordare quanto mi manchi mio padre."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:217
translate italian jamie14_09aa50f4:

    # "They are pretty similar actually. Hard-working. Funny."
    "In realtà sono piuttosto simili. Lavoratori instancabili. Divertenti."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:218
translate italian jamie14_fdfc1ad7:

    # "Both of them have lost their wife too."
    "Entrambi hanno perso anche la moglie."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:219
translate italian jamie14_c5b26d00:

    # "But while Jamie's dad turned to his family after the death and held them closer, my dad had..."
    "Ma mentre il papà di Jamie si è rivolto alla sua famiglia dopo la morte e li ha tenuti più vicini a sé, mio padre aveva..."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:220
translate italian jamie14_1adb6623:

    # "... well, whatever my dad had done, I'm not really sure."
    "... beh, qualunque cosa abbia fatto mio padre, non ne sono proprio sicura."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:223
translate italian jamie14_398e8474:

    # "After dinner, Jamie and I sit in her backyard together, looking up at the stars."
    "Dopo cena, io e Jamie ci sediamo insieme nel suo giardino sul retro, a guardare le stelle."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:224
translate italian jamie14_c08e5558:

    # gnd "That was really nice."
    gnd "È stato davvero bello."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:225
translate italian jamie14_66c0b088:

    # pc "Yeah it was."
    pc "Sì, lo è stato."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:226
translate italian jamie14_73145f9f:

    # gnd "I love that we don't have to hide anymore."
    gnd "Adoro il fatto che non dobbiamo più nasconderci."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:227
translate italian jamie14_a8284af3:

    # pc "It's not going to ruin the passion?"
    pc "Non rovinerà la passione?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:230
translate italian jamie14_64527f8a:

    # gnd "Absolutely not."
    gnd "Assolutamente no."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:231
translate italian jamie14_37ba49d4:

    # gnd "I don't think Daddy is gonna want us having sex at the house or anything..."
    gnd "Non credo che papà vorrà che facciamo sesso a casa o cose del genere..."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:232
translate italian jamie14_86cdae76:

    # gnd "... but I can't wait to spend another night with you."
    gnd "... ma non vedo l’ora di passare un’altra notte con te."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:233
translate italian jamie14_04491fb2:

    # pc "Want to come over tonight?"
    pc "Vuoi venire da me stasera?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:236
translate italian jamie14_5632c3e4:

    # gnd "Soon, but not tonight."
    gnd "Presto, ma non stasera."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:237
translate italian jamie14_33db0ab9:

    # gnd "I think I need to talk to Daddy some alone, you know?"
    gnd "Penso di dover parlare un po’ da sola con papà, capisci?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:238
translate italian jamie14_9d09aa00:

    # gnd "It seems like we're better, but we still have some things we need to work through."
    gnd "Sembra che le cose vadano meglio, ma abbiamo ancora alcune questioni da risolvere."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:239
translate italian jamie14_34b44705:

    # pc "I understand."
    pc "Capisco."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:242
translate italian jamie14_8749741d:

    # gnd "But things are going to be good, I know it."
    gnd "Ma andrà tutto bene, lo so."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:243
translate italian jamie14_677d7bb7:

    # gnd "Thanks for everything, [pcname]."
    gnd "Grazie di tutto, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:244
translate italian jamie14_fe2167ed:

    # gnd "I know it probably wasn't easy to make tonight happen, to patch things up with Daddy."
    gnd "So che probabilmente non è stato facile organizzare questa serata, per ricucire i rapporti con papà."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:245
translate italian jamie14_56e12139:

    # gnd "So thank you for doing that. For not holding things against him."
    gnd "Quindi grazie per averlo fatto. Per non avergli serbato rancore."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:248
translate italian jamie14_d41d8cd9_5:

    # voice "voices/jamie_022.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_022.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:249
translate italian jamie14_f9831d1e:

    # gnd "I love you, [pcname]."
    gnd "Ti voglio bene, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:250
translate italian jamie14_5e3e613a:

    # pc "I love you too, Jamie."
    pc "Anch’io ti voglio bene, Jamie."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:251
translate italian jamie14_53a4b911:

    # "We lie there for a while longer, holding each other and enjoying the cool night air."
    "Restiamo lì distesi ancora un po’, abbracciati, godendoci la fresca aria della notte."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:254
translate italian jamie14_f4805d30:

    # "Then I tell her and Rich goodbye and go back over to my house, leaving them to work out whatever they need to."
    "Poi saluto lei e Rich e torno a casa mia, lasciando che siano loro a risolvere ciò che devono risolvere."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:255
translate italian jamie14_acdbbb7b:

    # "It feels like Jamie and I took a big step in our relationship today."
    "Mi sembra che oggi io e Jamie abbiamo fatto un grande passo avanti nella nostra relazione."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:256
translate italian jamie14_9d2f13b4:

    # "Things are getting more serious. I promised her dad that I wouldn't hurt her."
    "Le cose si stanno facendo più serie. Ho promesso a suo padre che non le avrei fatto del male."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie14.rpy:257
translate italian jamie14_ad87ea57:

    # "I hope I can keep that promise."
    "Spero di poter mantenere quella promessa."

